# World Cup 2026 — AI Content Automation Engine

A fully automated social media content pipeline built during the FIFA World Cup 2026. The system monitors live match data, generates AI-written content, renders branded graphics and short-form videos, and publishes everything to X and Instagram — with zero manual input from lineup announcement to post-match analysis.

