## What It Does

Every World Cup match day, this engine automatically:

1. Detects upcoming fixtures and queues them for processing
2. Posts a branded lineup graphic to X and Instagram 10 minutes before kickoff
3. Posts an AI-written match analysis graphic and a tournament progression graphic 2 hours after kickoff
4. Searches, filters, renders and publishes highlight clips as Instagram Reels 9 hours after kickoff

All graphics carry a custom watermark. All captions are AI-generated. No human input required at any stage.

