## System Architecture

```
00:00 UTC Daily
    Scenario 1 — fetches today's WC fixtures → populates Match_Queue sheet

Apps Script polls every 5 minutes:

    T-10min     →  fires Lineup webhook      →  Scenario 2
    T+2h        →  fires Post-Match webhook  →  Scenario 4
    T+9h        →  fires Clip webhook        →  Scenario 3

Status chain per match:
    blank → Lineup_Sent → Analysis_Sent → Finished
```

The status column in Google Sheets is the single source of truth — each status value gates the next trigger, making double-firing impossible.

